<div class="frame" style="width: 380px; height: 1060px;">
  <div class="apphead" style="padding: 0 16px; gap: 10px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.2px;">Advantage</span>
    <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
    <span style="display: block; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--ink-100);"></span>
  </div>
  <div style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; min-height: 0; background: var(--surface-muted);">
    <div class="rail" style="flex: 0 0 300px; background: var(--surface-card); gap: 18px;">
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Result</span>
        <!-- The score as a result you can read set by set, not one string.
             Winner's row carries the ink; the dot marks who served first. -->
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding-bottom: 7px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
            <span style="flex-grow: 1;"></span>
            <span class="eyebrow-sm" style="width: 26px; text-align: center;">1</span>
            <span class="eyebrow-sm" style="width: 26px; text-align: center;">2</span>
            <span class="eyebrow-sm" style="width: 26px; text-align: center;">3</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 9px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-hairline);">
            <span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--blue); margin-right: 8px;"></span>
            <span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;">M. Ellison</span>
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--viz-good)" stroke-width="2" style="margin-right: 6px;" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            <span class="tabular" style="width: 26px; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400;">6</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="width: 26px; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-400);">3</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="width: 26px; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400;">7</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 9px 0;">
            <span style="width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-right: 8px;"></span>
            <span style="flex-grow: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-600);">R. Duval</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="width: 26px; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-400);">4</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="width: 26px; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-600);">6</span>
            <span class="tabular" style="width: 26px; text-align: center; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink-400);">5</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Detail</span>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;"><span class="micro">Date</span><span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-900);">Mar 14, 2026</span></div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;"><span class="micro">Surface</span><span class="micro" style="color: var(--ink-900);">Hard</span></div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;"><span class="micro">Duration</span><span class="micro tabular mono" style="color: var(--ink-900);">02:14:38</span></div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;"><span class="micro">Points</span><span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-900);">247</span></div>
        <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between;"><span class="micro">Games</span><span class="micro tabular" style="color: var(--ink-900);">31</span></div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--surface-subtle); padding: 11px 12px;">
        <span class="eyebrow-sm">Match data</span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 100%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 86%;"></span>
        <span class="bar" style="width: 54%;"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="cap">
    <h3>Rail 2 &mdash; Scoreboard</h3>
    <p>The identity block becomes a real scoreboard: a row per player, a column per set, the dropped set greyed and the serving player marked. Facts drop their icons for a label/value list, which is how the rest of the site sets out a spec.</p>
    <p class="trade">Taller than the string it replaces, and a five-setter or a tiebreak column needs a rule for where the extra numbers go.</p>
  </div>
</div>
